0..72 Comment "//! A reflexivity that a field holds at a path type the family computes."
73..76 Comment "//!"
77..147 Comment "//! The family of `Held` returns a path type whose left endpoint calls"
148..227 Comment "//! `twofold`. Both checkers must read the path\'s endpoints at the same values,"
228..295 Comment "//! or the kernel refuses the reflexivity that the checker accepts."
296..299 Comment "//!"
300..377 Comment "//! The checker reads the field\'s type by its own evaluation, so it reads `Z`"
378..457 Comment "//! for `twofold Z` and records no dialogue for that endpoint. The kernel reads"
458..533 Comment "//! the decode by its own evaluator, and it reads the endpoints of the path"
534..565 Comment "//! type by that evaluator too."
566..569 Comment "//!"
570..586 Comment "//! - see: #5364"
